-- title:
--   Tame generator for inertia at a finite Galois level
-- statement:
--   Let $q$ be a prime and let $G_q := \mathrm{Aut}_{\mathbb{Q}_q}(\overline{\mathbb{Q}_q})$ be the local Galois group `primeLocalGaloisGroup q`, with $r :=$ `primeLocalToGlobal q` the homomorphism $G_q \to \mathrm{Aut}_{\mathbb{Q}}(\overline{\mathbb{Q}})$ obtained by restricting scalars to $\mathbb{Q}$ and then restricting to the normal subextension $\overline{\mathbb{Q}}$. Let $P :=$ `primeLocalPlace q` be the valuation subring of $\overline{\mathbb{Q}}$ pulled back from $\mathbb{Z}_q$ along the chosen embedding, and let $\varphi \in G_q$ be such that $r(\varphi)$ lies in the decomposition subgroup of $P$ over $\mathbb{Q}$ and acts on the residue field of $P$ by $x \mapsto x^q$. Let $F$ be an intermediate field of $\overline{\mathbb{Q}}/\mathbb{Q}$ that is finite-dimensional and Galois over $\mathbb{Q}$. Write $I := r^{-1}(I(P))$, where $I(P)$ is the inertia subgroup of $P$ over $\mathbb{Q}$ viewed inside $\mathrm{Aut}_{\mathbb{Q}}(\overline{\mathbb{Q}})$, and $U := r^{-1}(\mathrm{Fix}(F))$ for $\mathrm{Fix}(F)$ the subgroup of $\mathrm{Aut}_{\mathbb{Q}}(\overline{\mathbb{Q}})$ fixing $F$ pointwise. Then there exist $t \in I$ and a subgroup $W \leq G_q$ with: $U \leq W \leq I \sqcup U$ (the subgroup generated by $I$ and $U$); $W$ normal in $G_q$; for every $w \in W$ some $a \in \mathbb{N}$ with $w^{q^a} \in U$; for every $i \in I$ some $a \in \mathbb{N}$ with $(t^a)^{-1} i \in W$; and $(t^{q})^{-1}\,\varphi t \varphi^{-1} \in W$.
--
--   This is the classical structure of inertia at a finite level: modulo the level subgroup $U$ the image of inertia has a normal wild ($q$-group) part $W/U$ with cyclic quotient generated by a tame generator $t$, on which an arithmetic Frobenius acts by $t \mapsto t^q$, i.e. the Iwasawa relation $\varphi t \varphi^{-1} = t^{q}$ holds modulo $W$. It feeds the local computations at Taylor–Wiles primes, being cited by [`ExtCitation.exists_eq_kummerCharacter_pow`](thm.html#ExtCitation.exists_eq_kummerCharacter_pow), [`ExtCitation.exists_tame_generator_at_level_of_dvd`](thm.html#ExtCitation.exists_tame_generator_at_level_of_dvd) and [`ExtCitation.tame_or_descent_of_isSimple`](thm.html#ExtCitation.tame_or_descent_of_isSimple).
-- source:
--   https://github.com/anthropics/fermats-last-theorem/blob/aa2d8b34692b16c70f699536de0d8e75b9a3e9ef/Theorems/Thm_ExtCitation_exists_tame_generator_at_level.lean

